# This network blocks direct Tor: every relay connection timed out
# (WSAETIMEDOUT) across many addresses and ports. The bridges below are the same
# obfs4 bridges this machine's Tor Browser already uses, which is itself
# evidence the block is real rather than a misconfiguration here.

